  "releaseNotes": "0.2.0 adds capability-driven focus, bracketed-paste, mouse, and richer traditional modified-key input through the single bounded TerminalSession event path, plus reversible input-protocol leases and per-session decoder policy. The release is accepted by Icod.DCurses and validated through package-only consumers on net8.0, net9.0, and net10.0 across Windows, Linux, and macOS.",
